    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MORTICIA: You are a desperate woman, consumed by greed and infinite bitterness. We could have been such friends.\nABIGAIL: I don't think so. The vault, Mrs. Addams - any thoughts?\nMORTICIA: Despite everything, I don't hate you. I pity you. Persecution, fiendish torture, inhuman depravity - sometimes it's just not enough.\nABIGAIL: Gordon - let's get started.",
      "MORTICIA: Oh yes - in the den.\nMARGARET: Trick or treat!",
      "MARGARET: And what are you, darling? Where's your costume?\nWEDNESDAY: This is my costume. I'm a homicidal maniac. They look just like everyone else."
    ]
